<title>MALAYSIA: ASEAN ministers seek clarification on Cambodia.</title>
<headline>ASEAN ministers seek clarification on Cambodia.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southeast Asian foreign ministers have asked Cambodian foreign minister Ung Huot to return to Phnom Penh and straighten out Cambodia's position on ASEAN mediation, Philippine Foreign Minister Domingo Siazon said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We would like to have a clear-cut statement so that the understanding is the same for everyone,&quot; he said after the close of the annual Association of South East Asian Nations (ASEAN) foreign ministers conference.</p>
</text>
